- Boc-protected o-phenylenediamine (CC(C)(C)OC(=O)Nc1ccccc1N): $7.0 for 1g  
- Cinnamic acid sulfonyl chloride (O=C(O)/C=C/c1ccc(S(=O)(=O)Cl)cc1): $295.0 for 1g

